B C4 Sample · Subject Aliases" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="32" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="6" value="Cap Each Relation&#xa;Stop Each Relation at 2,000 Triples&#xa;Increase Relation-type Diversity" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1024" y="32" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="7" value="Authors Manually Annotate Templates&#xa;One Final Natural-language Template per Relation&#xa;Appendix Table 2 Lists All 16 Templates" style="shape=document;boundedLbl=1;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9E9E9E;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1280" y="32" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="8" value="Instantiate Each Question&#xa;Substitute Subject S&#xa;Use the Template for R&#xa;Produce a Natural-language Question" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1544" y="32" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="9" value="Close the Acceptable Answer Set&#xa;Include Every Entity E&#xa;Where (S, R, E) Exists in Wikidata&#xa;Use All Such Entities as Gold Answers" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strok